    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "framework",
      "narration_text": "Start with names, because the industry blurs them on purpose. An AI model is a generated body made to wear a product — a still, a lookbook page, a size run. A virtual influencer is different: an ongoing persona with a feed and a calendar. Human talent is a third machine: a person who can refuse, age, and walk away. Those are not synonyms.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24,
