    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "worked example",
      "narration_text": "This is the campaign model. Not a person. A file. One coat, many looks — minted to fill the grid. Levi's announced a test of this idea: AI-generated models to show more bodies on the same product, as a supplement to live shoots. After the backlash, they clarified it was not their diversity strategy. The mechanism remains. The face became stock.",
