    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "luxury perspective",
      "narration_text": "Luxury sold craft, scarcity, and a human witness — someone who stood next to the object. Virtual influencers already walked in. Lil Miquela, a CGI character launched in twenty sixteen, took over Prada's Instagram at Milan Fashion Week, and appeared with Bella Hadid for Calvin Klein. The shift: desire used to need a person you might meet. Now it can be aimed at a file the brand owns.",
