      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "verdict",
      "narration_text": "Let's recap with Claude. An AI model is inventory. A virtual influencer is a persona on a timer. Luxury is the industry that told you the human was the point. If the face is owned, the object might still be crafted — but the proof of presence is gone. Ask who can refuse the picture. If nobody can, you are not looking at a person. You are looking at control.",
