    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "handoff",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. A luxury house just sent me a campaign with an AI-generated face. Explain (1) the difference between an AI campaign model and a virtual influencer, (2) what the brand now controls that a human model could refuse, and (3) three questions I should ask before I treat the image as proof of craft or real presence. That prompt forces the three-way split we just drew. If the answer collapses it back into the word AI, push. Take this prompt, run it on a campaign you actually care about.",
